  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "A photograph of a hand holding a blank CDC 'COVID-19 Vaccination Record Card', in English and Spanish, with fields for name, date of birth and patient number, and rows for 1st and 2nd dose COVID-19 and two 'Other' doses, each with product name/manufacturer and lot number, date, and healthcare professional or clinic site. In Figure 2 it is format 2, a national immunization home-based record.",
      "state": "draft",
